{"3864940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trainwatch", "steam_appid": 3864940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Troy,</strong> the new <strong>Gatekeeper</strong> at a desolate railway crossing in the middle of nowhere, desperately trying to save his marriage. The job is supposed to be simple: <strong>spend one month at the Tower, control the crossing gate, stay sober, and prove to his wife that he can change</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While train schedules and daily errands keep you inside, something waits in the fog beyond the crossing. <strong>Unraveling the mystery and helping Troy fix his life will be harder than you think.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trainwatch</strong> is a new <strong>time-management psychological horror</strong> from <strong>Harvester Games,</strong> the acclaimed solo developer behind <strong>The Cat Lady, Downfall, Lorelai, and Burnhouse Lane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/181072f39e707820b9b064f84b8ca404.poster.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/181072f39e707820b9b064f84b8ca404.webm?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/181072f39e707820b9b064f84b8ca404.mp4?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check the timetable. Lower the gates, watch the train pass, and raise them again.</strong> A Gatekeeper’s work is simple, repetitive, almost tedious – until every errand, every strange call, and every step into the fog makes you question what is really important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the routine, respect the clock, but most importantly keep your promise to <strong>call your wife every single day</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/33b164a2e05be581c9997c37dc5ecf6e.poster.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/33b164a2e05be581c9997c37dc5ecf6e.webm?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/33b164a2e05be581c9997c37dc5ecf6e.mp4?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is calling from the fog beyond the crossing. Venture outside to meet <strong>strange neighbors</strong> and <strong>explore occult grounds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover locked places, hidden paths, and secrets never meant for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.poster.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.webm?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.mp4?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Troy’s sanity and stamina meters high</strong>. If you fail, then hunger, exhaustion, fear, and neglect will wear him down, while every missed call with his wife pushes him closer to a relapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work the shift, unlock new skills, go fishing, brew the coffee – do</strong> <strong>whatever it takes to stay sober.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/38d662001f94f950d730ee9be7d94e55.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains come and go, strangers ask for help, while daily errands and distractions pile up. All the while, the fog keeps calling as you try to be a better man. You're on the clock, and you can't chase every lead, keep every promise, or make every day perfect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide what matters most and learn to let go. <strong>You have only one month to try and fix Troy's life</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Troy,</strong> the new <strong>Gatekeeper</strong> at a desolate railway crossing in the middle of nowhere, desperately trying to save his marriage. The job is supposed to be simple: <strong>spend one month at the Tower, control the crossing gate, stay sober, and prove to his wife that he can change</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While train schedules and daily errands keep you inside, something waits in the fog beyond the crossing. <strong>Unraveling the mystery and helping Troy fix his life will be harder than you think.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c