teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/33b164a2e05be581c9997c37dc5ecf6e.mp4?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is calling from the fog beyond the crossing. Venture outside to meet <strong>strange neighbors</strong> and <strong>explore occult grounds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover locked places, hidden paths, and secrets never meant for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.poster.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.webm?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/f3dffc319fc889baee500e3b2ebe38cd.mp4?t=1788255246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Troy’s sanity and stamina meters high</strong>. If you fail, then hunger, exhaustion, fear, and neglect will wear him down, while every missed call with his wife pushes him closer to a relapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work the shift, unlock new skills, go fishing, brew the coffee – do</strong> <strong>whatever it takes to stay sober.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/38d662001f94f950d730ee9be7d94e55.avif?t=1788255246\" width=960 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains come and go, strangers ask for help, while daily errands and distractions pile up. All the while, the fog keeps calling as you try to be a better man. You're on the clock, and you can't chase every lead, keep every promise, or make every day perfect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide what matters most and learn to let go. <strong>You have only one month to try and fix Troy's life</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "A time-management psychological horror set in a fogbound railway crossing. What seems like a simple 1-month job as a gatekeeper operating a crossing turns into an exploration of occult grounds, meeting unsettling folk, and trying to fix your own life.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/0c209327c23b976abbf42e809760b0fed1f24fc5/header.jpg?t=1788255246", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/93140fda73789e84951c118b8793fadffefc44cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788255246", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/93140fda73789e84951c118b8793fadffefc44cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788255246", "website": "https://harvester-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 960, Radeon RX 570 or equivalent with 4GB of video RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class